{"reviews":[{"id":"B071H2XBYK-0","r":5.0,"t":"Works and There\u2019s so many colors","x":"I LOVE the variety of colors. They are comfortable and doesn\u2019t need slip as much due to the coating on the underside.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I\u2019ve been looking for a nice thick band just like this. It holds in place and doesn\u2019t move.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-2","r":5.0,"t":"For the price, these are great!","x":"I spent FOREVER looking for a headband like these, but didn't want to throw down $20 for three Nike ones that I'd probably lose anyway.  These are great! I'm an adult, but have a small head (& BUT A BIG BRAIN). These fit me perfectly and only made my head start aching a little after 10 or so hours. The assortment of colors is great. The quality is whatever; wore one and it snapped suddenly and flew off into the dark abyss of the bar I was in. This was the first time I'd worn it. Funny/memorable,","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-3","r":5.0,"t":"Very nice","x":"Actually using, with a knot in it, to tag baby goats arund their necks. Soft and pretty colors. Launders well.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-4","r":5.0,"t":"Works well","x":"I use these for working out and it works well. Nice variety of colors.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-5","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect headbands","x":"Love that these headbands don\u2019t move and stay in place all day","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-6","r":5.0,"t":"Cute Colors and they Stay Put","x":"Love the color variety, and how easily the bands stay on","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-7","r":5.0,"t":"They work","x":"The ONLY headbands that actually stay on my head!","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"I bought these headbands for my 10 year old granddaughter. She loves them.","h":20,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-9","r":5.0,"t":"Actually stays put!","x":"Great price and great product for anyone who goes to the gym everyday!","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-10","r":2.0,"t":"Not created equal","x":"I was really excited when I ordered these especially after reading the reviews. Well, they are not all created equal. They are all slightly a different size. Some are too tight, some are too loose and some just break. I have been wearing a different one each day to work. I am not happy with this product and will search for something better.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-11","r":4.0,"t":"I liked the colors of these headbands","x":"I liked the colors of these headbands, but I found them to be rather tight around my head. The rubber strip on the underside of the band really does work, and these bands did not fall off of my head.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-12","r":2.0,"t":"pretty but tight for an adult","x":"LOVED the colors and the idea of the non slip plastic coating on one side. BUT way too tight for an adult to wear comfortably. Another product to give away!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-13","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly what I was looking for","x":"By far the best out there. Doesn't slip or give you a headache (except sometimes when I have my glasses on and they push on the band) Nice color assortment","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-14","r":5.0,"t":"loved them !!","x":"these were for my granddaughter who has long thin hair and she said they were perfect to use especially  when playing field hockey..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-15","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Not so comfortable when I wear it.  It does not work for me for some reasons.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-16","r":2.0,"t":"Do not stay in place!","x":"These do not stay in place at all. They are constantly sliding off.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-17","r":2.0,"t":"Doesn't fit well!","x":"I bought this for my daughter. I was happy to see so many different colors. However, when I put it on my daughter they just slip off after some time. My daughter got irritated with it. I tried it on myself as well. I have hair till my waist line. I tied a braid and then put the headband on but after sometime it just slipped from my head. So I will not recommend it.  Especially when you say Sports Headband, it should stay in it place as you will be doing lot of moving but this doesn't serve the p","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-18","r":3.0,"t":"They are so small :(","x":"These seem to be made pretty decently & have a nice variety of colors  but they are so small. Even though I have a small head, they seem to keep creeping up and I keep pulling them back into place all day. I like using headbands at work to keep my hair out of my face, but I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll be using these for that purpose unfortunately.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-19","r":5.0,"t":"So far, so good","x":"I haven\u2019t used them extensively but seem good so far. I haven\u2019t worn one for an extremely long time but I can see where it might feel tight after an extended period. I do like the variety of bright colors.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-20","r":1.0,"t":"Very tight","x":"These were bought for a 10 year old girl and were too tight for her to put on her head.  We had to return them.  Bought another brand and they were perfectly comfy and she loves them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-21","r":2.0,"t":"Pretty colors; don't grip well","x":"Love the colors, however, they don't grip well and keep popping off my head. In fact, the silicone lining is starting to come apart. Would NOT order these again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-22","r":2.0,"t":"Nice quality but too small","x":"These headbands are nice quality and pretty colors, but way too small for an adult head -- even a small adult head.  They may fit a grade school-sized girl.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-23","r":1.0,"t":"Too tight for size 7-1/4 hat size","x":"Instead headache as these are way too tight. I have a 7-1/4 hat size and these bands are ridiculously tight. I put one on and had a headache within minutes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B071H2XBYK-24","r":1.0,"t":"Junk","x":"Cheap, small and silicone is not sufficient to keep them in place. Don't waste your money. They're basically a bra strap with some silicon on the back.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the wide variety of colors.","cites":[1,5,7,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the headbands stay in place and don't slip.","cites":[1,2,6,7,8,10,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the headbands too tight, especially for adults.","cites":[11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers note inconsistent sizing, with some bands too tight, too loose, or breaking.","cites":[11]},{"text":"Reviewers consider the headbands good value for the price.","cites":[3,10]}]},"qa":[]}